    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kūtūma nhūng'wa kūlī Isaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Hezekia aho wigwa ī yenīyo, ūtandūla ī shizwalo shakwe, ūzwala magūnīla hūna ūja mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbatūma ba Eliakimu ūyo walī ntaale wa batūmami ba ng'wikūlū, na Shebuna, ū ng'wandīki, na a babo balī batongeeji ba bagabīji; būja kūlī ng'hangi Isaya ng'wana o ng'wa Amozi. A bose baaja bazwalile shizwalo sha mgūnīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūkang'wīla, “Ū ntemi Hezekia alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ī lelo lūlī lūshikū lwa būpīna, kūsondagūlwa na magooke; īlī gīt'ūmo ikanza lya baana kūbyalwa līkashikaga, alīyo jabiza jitīho ī nguzu ja kūbabyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo shi ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akwīyiigwa pyī ī mihayo ya ntaale wa bashilikale, ūyo watūmilwe nū ise būgonzo, ū ntemi wa Ashulu, kwiza kūnsondagūla ū Mulungu mpanga. Hamo akūng'hama kūlwa nguno ya mihayo īyo wīyigwaga ū SEEBA Mulungu wako. Alilūūlū, tūlīkwikūmbīlīja ūbalombele a banhū abo basaagile.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami ba ntemi Hezekia aho bashika ū kūlī Isaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Isaya ūbawīla, “Ū sīng'we būgonzo ng'wīlagi gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA alīhaya: Lekaga ū kogoha kūlwa mihayo īyo wīyigwaga, īyo bītūmamīlaga a batūmami ba ntemi wa Ashulu kūnisondagūla nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, degelekagi! Ū ng'wenūyo nakūntūūlīla moyo gwa kūng'winha kwigwa lūkumo lūlebe, hūna ashoke kū sī yakwe; ūlū ūshika koi nakūng'wīta abūlagwe bo lūshū.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa ū ntaale wa bashilikale ng'wenūyo wigwa gīkī ū ntemi wa Ashulu wīngile ī Lakishi, ūshokanya. Wahayūshika koi ūnsanga ū ntemi akūlwaga būlūgū na Libuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū ntemi wa Ashulu wenhelwa ng'hūlū, gīkī ntemi Tilihaka wa Esiopia, aliza kūndumīla kwilwisha būlūgū nang'hwe. Hūna ūtūma banhū hangī ū kūlī Hezekia kūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wīlagi ū Hezekia ū ntemi wa Yuda gīkī, Ūtizūnzunīlīja ū mulungu wako ūyo ūnsendamīlile ng'wenūyo, ikale akūkūlembagūlaga alīkūwīla gīkī, ‘Ī Yelusalemu ītūtūūlwa mu makono ga ntemi wa Ashulu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe wīyiigwa īyo batemi ba Ashulu bajīītīla pyī ī sī; ūmo baajikenaagūlīla gete. Ū bebe ūkūpīla? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamulungu ba sī ījo bataale bane baajikenaagūla, bakīīta mhayo gose gose gwa kūjipīja ī sī jabo? A ba mulungu ba sī gītī ja Gozani, Halani, Lezefu; na banhū ba Edeni abo baalī bikaji ba mu sī ya Teli-asaali! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Hamasi alī halī, nū wa Alipadi; pyī nū ntemi wa nzengo gwa Sefavaimu, nūūlū ū wa Hena, nū wa Iva?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlomba kwa ng'wa Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia aho wīyanukūla ī nyalūba kūfuma ū kū banhū abo baalī batūng'wa wīsoma. Ūlinha mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūja nayo; ūshika wīkundūla wītūūla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hezekia ūnomba ū SEEBA alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA wa mabità, Mulungu wa Isilaeli, bebe ūyo wigasīgije isumbī lyako lya būtemi ha gatī gatī ya makelubi; bebe wike hū ūlī Mulungu wa mabūtemi ga mu sī jose; bebe ūyo ūlī meeja w'igūlū na sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA, tegaga ū gūtū gwako wigwe; loleechaga a miso gako Ee SEEBA, ūbone; īdegelekage ī mihayo ya ng'wa Senakelibu, īyo watūmaga kwiza kūnsondagūla Mulungu mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA, gūlī gwa ng'hana ī chene ī gīkī a batemi ba Baashulu baabakenaagūla a banhū benaba nī sī jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamulungu babo benabo baabaponya mu moto na kūbakenaagūla nguno batī bamulungu, mantī dūhū na mawe gabeejiwe na makono ga banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū Ee SEEBA Mulungu wise, tūpījage ū mu nkono gwakwe; a mabūtemi ga mu sī jose gadeebe gīkī ū bebe Ee SEEBA, hū ūlī Mulungu ūmò wike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgwa kwa ng'wa Senakelibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amozi ūtūma nhūng'wa ū kūlī Hezekia kūhaya, “Ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya, īkī wanilombaga ūlīng'haya Senakelibu ū ntemi wa Ashulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūūyū, ūyo alīgūhaya kūlwa nguno yakwe ū Senakelibu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, gūūyū ū mhayo ūyo alīgūhaya ū SEEBA kūlwa nguno ya ntemi wa Ashulu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgunanhi bo ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna malaika o ng'wa SEEBA wingīla ū mu ng'hambī ya Baashulu ūbūlaga banhū shihūmbī igana na makūmi anaane. Aho wela ī ntondo yaho ī dilū, a bapanga bībona pyī ī mibimba ya banhū benabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Senakelibu, ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūsambaagūla ī ng'hambī yakwe, ūshoka kaya Ninawi, ūūkikala kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò walamyaga mu hekalu ya ng'wa mulungu wakwe Nisilochi, bitūnja bakwe babīlī, Adulameleki na Sheleza būnchimagūla shū būmūlaga, hūna būtoloka būpeelela kū sī ya Alalati. Ng'witūnja wakwe Esahadoni ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
